{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"带着对那种不必防备的生活的牵挂往前，他反倒觉得它近了些。\",\n      \"key\": \"它近了些\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"以前他怕争取会磨掉那点温柔，就想退回安宁，仿佛这样还能保住它。\",\n      \"key\": \"退回安宁\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再把舍不得看成软弱，想护住那种生活的心也推着他担起眼前的事，没有让他厌倦自己珍惜的生活。\",\n      \"key\": \"推着他担起\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"熬过怀疑和疲惫，他又尝到当初相信那种生活时的高兴，不敢把它当成理所当然。\",\n      \"key\": \"理所当然\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕自己又把疲惫当软弱，硬撑到最后，反而磨掉想护住的温柔。\",\n      \"key\": \"想护住的温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"text\": \"那种生活还没回来，他也不肯把曾经得到的安宁说成没用。\",\n      \"key\": \"说成没用\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"text\": \"他不知道眼前的努力究竟能护住多少。\",\n      \"key\": \"护住多少\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-8\",\n      \"text\": \"真要付出代价时，他仍可能犹豫，想找个少伤一点的退路。\",\n      \"key\": \"少伤一点\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-9\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再靠硬撑证明自己该往前，力气放下来，想护住那种生活的心还在。\",\n      \"key\": \"心还在\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-8\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-9\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-9\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并调整前因\",\n      \"why\": \"保留带着牵挂行动后旧愿反而变近的变化。去掉 S12-3 的弱箭头，改由 S07-2 中不愿看着珍惜之物继续受损的行动理由支撑。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R66\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留过去想退回安宁以保住旧愿的念头，改成他当时害怕什么的平常说法。不再把 S06-7 或 S07-3 当作直接前因，因为它们没有明确建立这一退路想法。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R67\", \"R68\", \"R70\", \"R71\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"删去与 R68 重复的 R67，把旧愿成为行动理由写成他自己的想法。明确保留两种心意能够一起推动他、他不再为依恋羞愧，以及承担眼前的事没有使他厌倦所珍惜的生活。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R72\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"补回并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"明确保留经历怀疑和疲惫后重新尝到快乐、却不敢把它当成理所当然的认识，让快乐的回返既真实又显得珍贵。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-5\", \"S13-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"具体化并拆分\",\n      \"why\": \"不再用投入与愿望的抽象原则代替心理过程，而是写出他怕硬撑磨掉温柔，也不知道努力究竟能护住多少。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R73\", \"R74\", \"R77\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-6\", \"S13-7\", \"S13-8\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"分别保留旧愿尚未实现、行动结果没有保证，以及未来仍可能因代价犹豫这三层不同的不确定性，避免反复总结整合尚未完成。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R75\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\", \"S13-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他不再让行动压住对安宁的牵挂，也不因心愿未成就把曾经得到的安宁说成没用。把两层意思分别放进依恋推动行动和不否定真实满足的经历中，不再写成抽象的两边对照。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R76\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\", \"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写为具体取舍\",\n      \"why\": \"不再用哪些值得付出、哪些不能丢掉的概括替他宣布领悟，而由他愿意为珍惜的生活承担事情、又怕硬撑磨掉温柔，具体呈现行动的理由与限度。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R78\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-9\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他不再靠硬撑证明自己该向前，也不再需要更多证明的变化。补上力气放下后仍清楚留着的保护之心，让末尾低处的轻声与高处孤悬的亮光有具体的心理依据。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7cbfdf75-8f9a-4475-84d5-c38ce9a18897", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T170938972312Z", "elapsed_seconds": 742.953, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T17:22:01.958003+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e0b8ec3911004a8b451e119c7805c612853ffe5929084210f07de50528837f8e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T170938972312Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "f6611cbfd20dd59413a2c53d175454567c71f59f1b5c14af50330120ae3bcafd"}}}
